XXXX Bank is the bank used by my employers payroll system. 
Because the restriction remained unresolved, I visited a local Bank of America XXXX XXXX on XX/XX/XXXX. While at the XXXX XXXX, staff attempted to contact internal  departments for clarification and escalation but were unable to reach anyone. I was informed that the issue would need to be escalated further, but no immediate resolution was provided. 
My employer and the payroll system confirmed that the payroll funds were successfully released and that there were no issues or restrictions on their end. However, they were unable to confirm whether any fraud claim, note, or restriction had been placed by XXXX Bank against the transaction or against me. 
I was later informed by the Bank of America XXXX XXXX that the restriction on my account could not be removed unless the issue or note at XXXX Bank was withdrawn. Bank of America has not provided documentation identifying the nature that note, whether it constitutes a fraud claim, or how it may be resolved. 
I submitted a signed letter from my employer verifying the legitimacy of the payroll transaction. This documentation has not resulted in any progress or resolution. 
